## 🚀 Overview
This project performs **big data analysis on the Superstore dataset** using **Apache PySpark** and generates insights through **data visualization tools like Matplotlib and Seaborn**.

It focuses on analyzing:
- 📈 Sales performance
- 🌍 Region-wise revenue
- 🏆 Top products
- 🗺️ State-wise distribution

